50]\r\n- Line wrap toggle does not update the status bar indicator [[#496](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/issues/496) [#497](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/497) [#570](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/570) @joschi @Scomocouk]\r\n- Close temp iid files used for docker and podman build [[#517](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/517) @testwill]\r\n\r\n### Additional Changes\r\n\r\n- Update dependencies [[#535](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/535) @reneleonhardt]\r\n- Fix typos [[#531](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/531) @kianmeng]\r\n- Make README.md installation commands easier to copy and paste [[#506](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/506) @ames0k0]\r\n- Update the README go install command to the latest version [[#509](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/509) @tgross35]\r\n- Remove repetitive words [[#515](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/515) @thirdkeyword]\r\n- Fix phony ci-release target [[#530](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/530) @st3iny]\r\n- Add warning message for snap installation approach on Ubuntu/Debian [[#552](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/552) @YuanfengZhang]\r\n- Update curl commands used for installation with `-f` [[#533](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/533) @guoard]\r\n- Describe what \"Fetching\" is really doing [[#482](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/482) @docwhat]\r\n- Login to GHCR as owner not actor [[#574](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/574) @polarathene]\r\n- Update README.md with DOCKER_HOST env var instructions [[#565](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/pull/565) @benjamin-brady]\r\n\r\n**[(Full Changelog)](https://github.com/wagoodman/dive/compare/v0.12.0...v0.13.0)**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wagoodman/dive/releases/207517813/reactions","total_count":41,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":7,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":23,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":27},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wagoodman/dive/releases/139692093","asse